                                                              "take":  "Damodaran is identifying a regime shift that markets have not fully priced: the era of \u0027grow at any cost\u0027 VC-backed businesses is running into a wall of rising rates and investor scrutiny. For public market investors, this is a useful filter ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â any company whose story depends on \u0027we\u0027ll figure out monetization at scale\u0027 deserves a much higher discount rate today than it would have received in 2021. The names most exposed are late-stage private companies still trading at peak-era multiples in secondary markets, and the venture funds holding them.",
